    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "This configures Ship.js to run only on `master` branch and merges the release PR back to `master`.\r\n\r\nIn other words, it won't run on any other branches, including this `chore/add-shipjs` branch.\r\nSo unfortunately, you cannot try this before merging this PR.\r\n\r\nIf you really want to see how it'll work:\r\n- you can fork [this repo](https://github.com/eunjae-lee/instantsearch.js)\r\n- generate an access token [here](https://github.com/settings/tokens) with `repo` checked\r\n- write `.env` in your forked IS.js dir with the content `GITHUB_TOKEN=xxx`\r\n- run `yarn release:prepare`\r\n\r\nThen it will create a PR in your forked repo.",
