    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Ah yes!\r\nI need to explain about this a bit.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"204\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/499898/72119023-5f960680-3396-11ea-95ff-f1ab4580ae9b.png\">\r\n\r\nI was thinking of adding a slack notification on release (should've discussed earlier, though).\r\n\r\nIf we configure SLACK_INCOMING_HOOK as an env var at CircleCI, Ship.js will send notifications by default when:\r\n\r\n1. A release PR is prepared\r\n2. When release starts\r\n3. When release finishes\r\n\r\nWe already assign `@algolia/instantsearch-for-websites` as reviewer, so won't need (1).\r\n\r\n(2) is a bit excessive.\r\n\r\nSo that code block overrides (1) and (2) with null, and we will get only (3) to a slack channel. (We still need to discuss if we need this and which channel to use).",
